{"abstract":"During ship encounters, uncertainty surrounding other vessels’ intentions and future trajectories can complicate situation assessment. When encountering an erratic vessel, navigators will take precautionary actions to avoid any risk of collision. This paper introduces a new decision-making algorithm tailored to address uncertainty in vessel encounters at sea. The proposed method achieves this by defining the risk of a future scenario as the combination of two factors: the probability of collision and the magnitude of the uncertainty. As this method does not assume deterministic future trajectories for either of the vessels, it can therefore be applied to any pair of vessels, and it allows the use for anticipation of future behaviours of other vessels in a scene. The method is verified through a simulation study.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Hansen, Nicholas","Prabowo, Yaqub Aris","Papageorgiou, Dimitrios","Galeazzi, Roberto"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-775147"],"event":{"end":"2024-09-05","place":"Blacksburg, us","start":"2024-09-03","title":"15<sup>th</sup> IFAC Conference on Control Applications in Marine Systems, Robotics and Vehicles","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Collision avoidance","Decision making","Risk Assessment","Situation awareness"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"uncertainty aware decision making for safe navigation of autonomous ships","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ifacol.2024.10.058","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-775147","identifier":[{"id":"85211080037","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-2ff2b7e6-7174-485a-bea3-fb9df288ca26"],"keyword":["Collision avoidance","Decision-making","Risk assessment","Situation awareness"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-311FC5AFBB6B0166A94668B284C7336D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/380084182/pnha_et_al_uncertainty-aware_decision_making_for_safe_navigation_of_autonomous_ships.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ifacol.2024.10.058","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical and Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical and Photonics Engineering, Automation and Control"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Nicholas","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d79b2754-2197-48d4-bc85-9c4578cf9fb3","name":"Hansen, Nicholas","orcid":"0000-0001-9972-1649","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Yaqub Aris","key":"prabowopau","last":"Prabowo","locid":"dfe9d597-7087-43ed-b1e9-6041fbe64dc4","name":"Prabowo, Yaqub Aris","orcid":"0000-0002-2500-154X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Dimitrios","key":"papageorgioupau","last":"Papageorgiou","locid":"1731579d-4271-42df-864e-6013a9ce795c","name":"Papageorgiou, Dimitrios","orcid":"0000-0002-4900-4083","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Roberto","key":"galeazzipau","last":"Galeazzi","locid":"b66b869e-5eed-4d7a-bc66-7f5bc41d96f7","name":"Galeazzi, Roberto","orcid":"0000-0002-6047-7922","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ifacol.2024.10.058","issn":["24058963"],"issue":"20","journal":"IFAC-PapersOnLine","pages":"223-228","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"IFAC-PapersOnLine","volume":"58"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85211080037"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-2ff2b7e6-7174-485a-bea3-fb9df288ca26"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Uncertainty-Aware Decision Making for Safe Navigation of Autonomous Ships⁎","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-775147","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"This paper presents a novel method to quantify seafarers’ good seamanship during navigation scenarios with multi-vessel encounters, in open and confined waters, and to compute COLREG's-compliant path deviations for avoiding collision and grounding. Accurate quantification of good seamanship necessitates comprehensive information about the vessels state and the surrounding environment, obtainable through the AIS system and electronic nautical charts. Our work advances the current state-of-the-art by: (1) incorporating a normalized grounding risk for navigating confined waters, (2) factoring in speed changes for a probabilistic assessment of collision risk, and (3) considering the minimum possible scenario risk based on vessel kinodynamic constraints. The proposed method is evaluated using historical AIS data and sea charts of Danish waters. The evaluation results demonstrate improved fairness scoring by acknowledging that navigators may lack risk-free options.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Prabowo, Yaqub Aris","Hansen, Nicholas","Papageorgiou, Dimitrios","Galeazzi, Roberto"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-775956"],"event":{"end":"2024-09-05","place":"Blacksburg, us","start":"2024-09-03","title":"15<sup>th</sup> IFAC Conference on Control Applications in Marine Systems, Robotics and Vehicles","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Collision avoidance","Confined waters","Grounding avoidance","Risk Assessment"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"good seamanship score quantification in complex and congested waterways","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ifacol.2024.10.077","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-775956","identifier":[{"id":"85211137249","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-bb2d83e4-d32c-4371-b7a4-4ebe4744899f"],"keyword":["Collision avoidance","Confined waters","Good seamanship","Grounding avoidance","Multi-vessels encounters","Risk assessment"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-03C89FA1F718B207624197E93375D26A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ifacol.2024.10.077","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/380084446/1-s2.0-S2405896324018329-main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical and Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical and Photonics Engineering, Automation and Control"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Yaqub Aris","key":"prabowopau","last":"Prabowo","locid":"dfe9d597-7087-43ed-b1e9-6041fbe64dc4","name":"Prabowo, Yaqub Aris","orcid":"0000-0002-2500-154X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Nicholas","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d79b2754-2197-48d4-bc85-9c4578cf9fb3","name":"Hansen, Nicholas","orcid":"0000-0001-9972-1649","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Dimitrios","key":"papageorgioupau","last":"Papageorgiou","locid":"1731579d-4271-42df-864e-6013a9ce795c","name":"Papageorgiou, Dimitrios","orcid":"0000-0002-4900-4083","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","firs