":"haslerpedh","last":"Hasler","name":"Hasler, Berit","rank":13,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Brian H.","key":"jacobsenpedh","last":"Jacobsen","name":"Jacobsen, Brian H.","rank":14,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788793998216"],"isbn":["9788793998209"],"issn":["22451684"],"issue":"174","pages":"87-100","publisher":"DCA - Nationalt Center for Fødevarer og Jordbrug","series":"DCA rapport","status":"p","title":"Virkemidler til reduktion af kvælstofbelastningen af vandmiljøet"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Undetermined","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-c96e79c7-df62-47bc-9082-663308124ac9"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Tidlig såning af vintersæd","type":"Report Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-513731","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"The aim of this chapter is to present the Danish Nitrogen Mitigation Assessment (www.DNMARK.org), an ongoing five-year multidisciplinary research alliance, focusing on the quantification of nitrogen (N) flows and solutions scenarios for a more sustainable N use in Denmark. As one of the world's most agriculturally intensive countries, with a long N regulation history, and state-of-the-art monitoring of developments in key indicators for nitrogen losses, use and efficiency, Denmark is a case of special interest. Based on the results and recommendations from the European Nitrogen Assessment, DNMARK addresses all parts of the N cascade, and demonstrates results both at the landscape scale and the national scale. The national N flows and N balance are accounted for 1990-2010, and methods for the downscaling of these results to regional pilot study areas are developed, together with approaches for the integrated assessment and modelling of the three main types of solution scenarios defined: (i) New production chains with a more efficient use and recycling of N, (ii) Geographically differentiated N-measures implemented by cost-effective instruments with localized planning and management of agricultural landscapes, and (iii) Changed consumption patterns driving land use change and reducing N use.","author_count":27,"contributors":["Dalgaard, Tommy","Brock, Steen","Hansen, Birgitte","Hasler, Berit","Hertel, Ole","Hutchings, Nicholas John","Jacobsen, Brian H.","Jensen, Lars Stoumann","Kjeldsen, Chris","Kronvang, Brian","Olesen, Jørgen E","Schjørring, Jan K","Sigsgaard, Torben","Graversgaard, Morten","Hashemi, Fatemeh","Turner, Katrine Grace","Vejre, Henrik","de Vries, Wim","Wiborg, Irene A."],"cuid":["S02-094.77-019315"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Greenland","Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland","Wageningen University & Research"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-GEUS"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-SEGES"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-GEUS","DI-PR-SEGES","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dnmark danish nitrogen mitigation assessment research and know how for a sustainable low nitrogen food production","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85149056003","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-094.77-019315","identifier":[{"id":"85149056003","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-5b643c19-26eb-4b28-9fbb-e3e4aa01a264","ku-aaea03b5-dae9-4a1c-8c09-c987190ad538"],"keyword":["Denmark · Nitrogen assessment · Nitrogen flows · Solution scenarios · Sustainable nitrogen management"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-BF2DDFEA6C1440175472E1C4CFFB776E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Agroecology, Department of Agroecology - Agricultural Systems and Sustainability"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gl","key":"geological survey of denmark and greenland","loc":["Greenland","Nordic"],"name":"Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"geus geological survey of denmark and greenland","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-GEUS","l3nn":"GEUS Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland","loc":["Denm