rn Denmark"],"title":"C57BL/6J substrain differences in response to high-fat diet intervention","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-042906","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"This paper presents a novel human-machine collaborative approach to automatic quality-control of Glass-Fiber Reinforced Concrete (GFRC) molds directly on the factory floor. The framework introduces Industry 4.0 technologies to enhance the ability of skilled craftsmen to make molds through the provision of horizontal feedback regarding dimensional tolerances. Where digital tools are seldom used in the fabrication of GFRC molds, and expert craftsmen are not digital experts, our implementation of automated registration and feedback processes enables craftsmen to be integrated into and gain value from the digital production chain. In this paper, we describe the in-progress framework, Precision Partner, which connects 3d scanning and point cloud registration of geometrically complex and varied one off elements to factory floor dimensional feedback. We firstly introduce the production context of GFRC molds, as well as industry standards for production feedback. We then detail our methods, and report the results of a case study that tests the framework on the case of a balcony element","author_count":8,"contributors":["Nicholas, Paul","Rossi, Gabriella","Papadopoulou, Iliana","Tamke, Martin","Aalund Brandt, Nikolaj","Jessen Hansen, Leif"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-128333"],"event":{"end":"2020-09-17","place":"Berlin , de","start":"2020-09-16","title":"Anthropologic - Architecture and Fabrication in the cognitive age","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["3D scanning","Automation","Digital Chain","Feedback","GFRC","Human in the loop"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-ART","DI-PR"],"level3":{"ART":["DI-ART-ALL","DI-ART-RDKA"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"]},"level3all":["DI-ART-RDKA","DI-PR-OTH"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"precision partner enhancing gfrc craftsmanship with industry 000000000004 000000000000 factory floor feedback","src":["arkc"],"src-code":["DI-ART-RDKA"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://papers.cumincad.org/data/works/att/ecaade2020_264.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-128333","ids":["arkc-d503a162-b3d9-4d12-b739-72396dd5ee28"],"keyword":["3d scanning","Automation","Digital Chain","Feedback","GFRC","Human in the loop","No"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4882A21A556A6671586D6E9AC41F754C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://papers.cumincad.org/data/works/att/ecaade2020_264.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"royal danish academy architecture design conservation","l2":"DI-ART","l2n":"Artistic Higher Education Institutions","l3":"DI-ART-RDKA","l3nn":"Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation","namevar":["Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation","Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation, Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Institute of Architecture and Technology","Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Design, Conservation, Royal Danish Academy - Architecture, Institute of Architecture and Technology, CITA - Centre for Information Technology and Architecture"],"nora_code":"DI-ART-RDKA","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["BB fiberbeton"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Paul","key":"nicholaspau","last":"Nicholas","locid":"142af11d-0900-4f6d-91e5-62c57be0747d","name":"Nicholas, Paul","orcid":"0000-0003-2420-8351","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"a