{"abstract":"Saturated solutions of calcium L-lactate in water or in deuterium oxide continuously dissolve calcium L-lactate by addition of solid sodium D-gluconate and become strongly supersaturated in calcium D-gluconate due to no or slow precipitation. The quantification of total dissolved calcium allied with the calcium complexes equilibrium constants allowed an ion speciation, which shows an initial non-thermal and spontaneous supersaturation of more than a factor of 50 at 25 °C only slowly decreasing after initiation of precipitation of calcium D-gluconate after a lag phase of several hours. A mathematical model is proposed, based on numerical solution of coupled differential equations of dynamics of L-lactate and D-gluconate exchange during the lag phase for precipitation and during precipitation. A slow exchange of L-lactate coordinated to calcium with D-gluconate is indicated with a time constant of 0.20 h−1 in water and of 0.15 h−1 in deuterium oxide and a kinetic deuterium/hydrogen isotope effect of 1.25. Such spontaneous non-thermal supersaturation and slow ligand exchange with a pseudo first order equilibration process with a half-life of 3.5 h in water for calcium hydroxycarboxylates can help to understand the higher calcium bioavailability from calcium hydroxycarboxylates compared to simple salts.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Garcia, André Castilho","Hansen, Jesper S.","Bailey, Nicholas","Skibsted, Leif Horsfelt"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-040301"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, South"],"country":["Brazil"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Instituto Federal de Educação, Ciência e Tecnologia de São Paulo"],"keyword":["Calcium hydroxycarboxylates","Kinetic modelling","Supersaturation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"slow lactate gluconate exchange in calcium complexes during precipitation from supersaturated aqueous solutions","src":["ku","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-100.00-040301","identifier":[{"id":"85088014320","type":"scopus"},{"id":"33233167","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-122de808-265a-4c15-a3a3-5fd9265f8207","ruc-0bac6704-28af-4e71-bfa8-413bbfe8330c"],"keyword":["Calcium hydroxycarboxylates","Kinetic modelling","Supersaturation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-2ABB95B452E62F158173A10A60630095"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Food Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Science and Environment","Roskilde University, Department of Science and Environment, Centre for Frustrated Molecular Interactions","Roskilde University, Department of Science and Environment, Glass and Time","Roskilde University, Department of Science and Environment, Mathematics and Physics (IMFUFA)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"André C.","key":"garciapau","last":"Garcia","locid":"aae313ce-dffb-48bc-935b-6d25256312ca","name":"Garcia, André Castilho","name_org":"Garcia, André C.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Jesper Schmidt","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"413f2c94-d35d-4ae4-89f2-361d8fc3ccc3","name":"Hansen, Jesper Schmidt","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Nicholas","key":"baileypau","last":"Bailey","locid":"5dc0db10-4afc-4868-85f6-4872fbbc0686","name":"Bailey, Nicholas","orcid":"0000-0002-2519-2403","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Leif H.","key":"skibstedpau","last":"Skibsted","locid":"c8bd9975-50bb-4e25-8dd3-a3738a78ec9b","name":"Skibsted, Leif Horsfelt","name_org":"Skibsted, Leif H.","orcid":"0000-0003-1734-5016","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["33233167"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.foodres.2020.109539","issn":["09639969","18737145"],"issn_org":["09639969"],"issue":"137","journal":"Food Research International","paperid":"109539","status":"p","title":"Food Research International","volume":"137"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85088014320"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-122de808-265a-4c15-a3a3-5fd9265f8207","ruc-0bac6704-28af-4e71-bfa8-413bbfe8330c"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Slow lactate gluconate exchange in calcium complexes during precipitation from supersaturated aqueous solutions","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-040301","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Linket i højre side henviser til DCA rapporten. Dokumentet over linket er selve leveringen til ministeriet med følgebrev. I DCA-rapporten er der foretaget mindre sproglige og redaktionelle rettelser i forhold til versionen, som blev leveriet til ministeriet den 8. juli 2020. Derudover er der i kapitlet Afgasning af husdyrgødning kombineret med højere udnyttelseskrav for afgasset gødning sket en justering af beregningsgrundlaget af hensyn til overensstemmelse med seneste rådgivningsnotat på området. Ændringen påvirker ikke den kvalitative vurdering af klimaeffekten i kataloget. I Bilag 3, Klimagasser, er der desuden tilføjet et forklarende afsnit vedr. den indirekte N2O-emissionsfaktor relateret til nitratudvaskning.","author_count":40,"contributors":["Eriksen, Jørgen","Thomsen, Ingrid Kaag","Hoffmann, Carl Christian","Hasler, Berit","Jacobsen, Brian H.","Baattrup-Pedersen, Annette","Strandberg, Beate","Christensen, Bent Tolstrup","Boelt, Birte","Iversen, Bo Vangsø","Kronvang, Brian","Børgesen, Christen Duus","Abalos, Diego","Zak, Dominik Henrik","Hansen, Elly Møller","Blicher-Mathiesen, Gitte","Rubæk, Gitte Holton","Ørum, Jens Erik","Rasmussen, Jim","Audet, Joachim","Olesen, Jørgen E","Elsgaard, Lars","Munkholm, Lars Juhl","Jørgensen, Lise Nistrup","Martinsen, Louise","Bruus, Marianne","Carstensen, Mette Vodder","Pedersen, Michael Friis","Nørremark, Michael","Hutchings, Nicholas John","Gundersen, Per","Kudsk, Per","Sørensen, Peter","Lærke, Poul Erik","Gislum, René","van't Veen, Sofie Gyritia Madsen","Larsen, Søren Erik","Petersen, Søren O","Riis, Tenna","Jørgensen, Uffe"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-141740"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["T0 2020"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"]