{"abstract":"In the originally published version of this Article, the affiliation details for Santi González, Jian'an Luan and Claudia Langenberg were inadvertently omitted. Santi González should have been affiliated with 'Barcelona Supercomputing Center (BSC), Joint BSC-CRG-IRB Research Program in Computational Biology, 08034 Barcelona, Spain', and Jian'an Luan and Claudia Langenberg should have been affiliated with 'MRC Epidemiology Unit, University of Cambridge School of Clinical Medicine, Cambridge Biomedical Campus, Cambridge CB2 0QQ, UK'. Furthermore, the abstract contained an error in the SNP ID for the rare variant in chromosome Xq23, which was incorrectly given as rs146662057 and should have been rs146662075. These errors have now been corrected in both the PDF and HTML versions of the Article.","author_count":43,"contributors":["Bonàs-Guarch, Sílvia","Guindo-Martínez, Marta","Miguel-Escalada, Irene","Grarup, Niels","Sebastian, David","Rodriguez-Fos, Elias","Sánchez, Friman","Planas-Fèlix, Mercè","Cortes-Sánchez, Paula","González, Santi","Timshel, Pascal","Pers, Tune H.","Morgan, Claire C.","Moran, Ignasi","Atla, Goutham","González, Juan R.","Puiggros, Montserrat","Martí, Jonathan","Andersson, Ehm A.","Díaz, Carlos","Badia, Rosa M.","Udler, Miriam","Leong, Aaron","Kaur, Varindepal","Flannick, Jason","Jørgensen, Torben","Linneberg, Allan","Jørgensen, Marit E.","Witte, Daniel R.","Christensen, Cramer","Brandslund, Ivan","Appel, Emil V.","Scott, Robert A.","Luan, Jian'An","Langenberg, Claudia","Wareham, Nicholas J.","Pedersen, Oluf","Zorzano, Antonio","Florez, Jose C.","Hansen, Torben","Ferrer, Jorge","Mercader, Josep Maria","Torrents, David"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-007491"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Mercader, Josep Maria"],"country":["Spain","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Autonomous University of Barcelona","Barcelona Institute for Global Health","Barcelona Institute of Science and Technology","Barcelona Supercomputing Center (BSC-CNS)","Boston Children's Hospital","Broad Institute","CIBER Epidemiologia Y Salud Publica","CREAL","CSIC","Catalan Institution for Research and Advanced Studies","Centre for Genomic Regulation","Centro de Investigacion Biomedica en Red de Diabetes y Enfermedades Metabolicas Asociadas","Centro de Investigación Biomédica en Red (CIBER)","Consejo Superior de Investigaciones Científicas (CSIC)","Harvard Medical School","Harvard University","ICREA","Imperial College London","Institut d'Investigac'ons Biomedques August Pi Sunyer (IDiBAPS), Barcelona, Spain.","Institute for Research in Biomedicine","Joint BSC-CRG-IRB Research Program in Computational Biology","Massachusetts General Hospital","Massachusetts General Hospital, Boston, Massachusetts, USA.","Polytechnic University of Catalonia","Pompeu Fabra University","Spanish Council for Scientific Research (CSIC)","University of Barcelona","University of Cambridge"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"publisher correction re analysis of public genetic data reveals a rare x chromosomal variant associated with type 000000000002 diabetes","src":["aau","au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"djc","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-018-04170-3","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["1Barcelona Supercomputing