{"abstract":"The results of photoluminescence (PL) imaging performed with a laser line scan in a prototype setup are presented in this work. Here we show the PL images with the photovoltaic cell positioned at different distances from the laser line source, therefore with the beam at different intensities and line characteristics. This study is motivated by the time demanding process of acquiring luminescence images for accurate PV inspections in the field, usually made with electroluminescence imaging. The PL imaging induced by a laser line has the potential to be compact enough to be portable and carried out by drones for field inspections.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Benatto, Gisele Alves dos Reis","Chi, Mingjun","Jensen, Ole Bjarlin","Santamaria Lancia, Adrian Alejo","Riedel, Nicholas","Iandolo, Beniamino","Davidsen, Rasmus Schmidt","Hansen, Ole","Thorsteinsson, Sune","Poulsen, Peter Behrensdorff"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-738226"],"event":{"end":"2018-06-15","place":"Waikoloa, us","start":"2018-06-10","title":"7th World Conference on Photovoltaic Energy Conversion","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Defect detection","PV inspections","Photoluminescence imaging"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"photoluminescence imaging induced by laser line scan study for outdoor field inspections","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/150163569/Paper_PL_line.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-738226","identifier":[{"id":"85059902634","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-351ec883-19f3-4097-8575-8b747097468d"],"keyword":["Defect detection","PV inspections","Photoluminescence imaging"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-86D029B48B298647B9C8A707E561FA77"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/150163569/Paper_PL_line.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Photonics Engineering, Photovoltaic Materials and Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Gisele Alves dos Reis","key":"benattopau","last":"Benatto","locid":"eb8ed86a-7b80-4d8c-ab82-fa5299497f57","name":"Benatto, Gisele Alves dos Reis","orcid":"0000-0002-7776-1719","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mingjun","key":"chipau","last":"Chi","locid":"f0d81225-8ba7-42be-8b90-0465c88ceb89","name":"Chi, Mingjun","orcid":"0000-0001-5367-7072","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole Bjarlin","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"10955267-cc91-4a3b-8b6c-44dd5c85a87d","name":"Jensen, Ole Bjarlin","orcid":"0000-0002-4295-5951","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Adrian Alejo","key":"santamarialanciapau","last":"Santamaria Lancia","locid":"2b1634c6-1876-4bfc-b773-b1f07d9505e8","name":"Santamaria Lancia, Adrian Alejo","orcid":"0000-0001-7756-8364","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nicholas","key":"riedelpau","last":"Riedel","locid":"561a7f3d-1fdc-4d31-8965-820f128bfa21","name":"Riedel, Nicholas","orcid":"0000-0002-5654-4571","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Beniamino","key":"iandolopau","last":"Iandolo","locid":"c0c4533c-bb23-4497-8f1a-cc3291b1a7e7","name":"Iandolo, Beniamino","orcid":"0000-0002-5807-3531","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rasmus Schmidt","key":"davidsenpau","last":"Davidsen","locid":"9bf815fc-994c-4d99-b89c-28ce33e7f2a8","name":"Davidsen, Rasmus Schmidt","orcid":"0000-0002-5782-9018","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"8d678857-a721-4f7f-9a33-1dadb7401ce4","name":"Hansen, Ole","orcid":"0000-0002-6090-8323","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sune","key":"thorsteinssonpau","last":"Thorsteinsson","locid":"831fbf16-0dba-4594-b98f-b52bcb84874c","name":"Thorsteinsson, Sune","orcid":"0000-0002-8942-3784","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Behrensdorff","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"9b449377-be46-41a9-a86e-a62a8dcef700","name":"Poulsen, Peter Behrensdorff","orcid":"0000-0001-7317-4472","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/pvsc.2018.8547416","isbn":["9781538685297"],"pages":"0395-0399","publisher":"IEEE","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of 7th World Conference on Photovoltaic Energy Conversion"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85059902634"],"sdg":["7. Affordable and Clean Energy","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-351ec883-19f3-4097-8575-8b747097468d"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Photoluminescence Imaging Induced by Laser Line Scan: Study for Outdoor Field Inspections","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-738226","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Disorders of the brain can exhibit considerable epidemiological comorbidity and often share symptoms, provoking debate about their etiologic overlap. We quantified the genetic sharing of 25 brain disorders from genome-wide association studies of 265,218 patients and 784,643 control participants and assessed their relationship to 17 phenotypes from 1,191,588 individuals. Psychiatric disorders share common variant risk, whereas neurological disorders appear more distinct from one another and from the psychiatric disorders. We also identified significant sharing between disorders and a number of brain phenotypes, including cognitive measures. Further, we conducted simulations to explore how statistical power, diagnostic misclassification, and phenotypic heterogeneity affect genetic correlations. These results highlight the importance of common genetic variation as a risk factor for brain disorders and the value of heritability-based methods in understanding their etiology.","author_count":577,"contributors":["Anttila, Verneri","Bulik-Sullivan, Brendan","Finucane, Hilary K.","Walters, Raymond K.","Bras, Jose","Duncan, Laramie","Escott-Price, Valentina","Falcone, Guido J.","Gormley, Padhraig","Malik, Rainer","Patsopoulos, Nikolaos A.","Ripke, Stephan","Wei, Zhi","Yu, Dongmei","Lee, Phil H.","Turley, Patrick","Grenier-Boley, Benjamin","Chouraki, Vincent","Kamatani, Yoichiro","Berr, Claudine","Letenneur, Luc","Hannequin, Didier","Amouyel, Philippe","Boland, Anne","Deleuze, Jean-François","Duron, Emmanuelle","Vardarajan, Badri N.","Reitz, Christiane","Goate, Alison M.","Huentelman, Matthew J.","Kamboh, M. Ilyas","Larson, Eric B.","Rogaeva, Ekaterina","St George-Hyslop, Peter","Hakonarson, Hakon","Kukull, Walter A.","Farrer, Lindsay A.","Barnes, Lisa L.","Beach, Thomas G.","Demirci, F. Yesim","Head, Elizabeth","Hulette, Christine M.","Jicha, Gregory A.","Kauwe, John S.k.","Kaye, Jeffrey A.","Leverenz, James B.","Levey, Allan I.","Lieberman, Andrew P.","Pankratz,