{"abstract":"This work has the goal to perform outdoor defect detection imaging that will be used in a fast, accurate and automatic drone-based survey system for PV power plants. The imaging development focuses on techniques that do not require electrical contact, permitting automatic drone inspections to be perform quicker and with less manpower. The final inspection method will combine several techniques such as, infrared (IR), electroluminescence (EL), photoluminescence (PL), and visual imaging. Solar plant inspection in the future can be restricted only by imaging speed requirements, allowing an entire new perspective in large-scale PV inspection.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Benatto, Gisele Alves dos Reis","Riedel, Nicholas","Thorsteinsson, Sune","Poulsen, Peter","Thorseth, Anders","Dam-Hansen, Carsten","Mantel, Claire","Forchhammer, Søren","H. B. Frederiksen, Kenn","Vedde, Jan","Petersen, Michael","Voss, Henrik","Messerschmidt, Michael","Parikh, Harsh","Spataru, Sergiu","Sera, Dezso"],"cuid":["S02-091.32-008839"],"event":{"end":"2017-06-30","place":"Washington D.C, us","start":"2017-06-25","title":"2017 IEEE 44th Photovoltaic Specialists Conference","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Electroluminescence imaging","Image processing","Photoluminescence imaging"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["SiCon • Silicon and PV consulting"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"development of outdoor luminescence imaging for drone based pv array inspection","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/PVSC.