8d2d-46ca-85b2-a61e5a2c6154","name":"Vesterdal, Lars","orcid":"0000-0003-0309-3735","rank":30,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ivan A.","key":"janssenspau","last":"Janssens","name":"Janssens, Ivan A.","rank":31,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.5194/bg-13-5567-2016","issn":["17264170","17264189"],"issn_org":["17264170"],"issue":"19","journal":"Biogeosciences","pages":"5567-5585","status":"p","title":"Biogeosciences","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84990841757"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","KU University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-46726070-2ee3-4166-87af-cc656a0af6f6"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Trends in soil solution dissolved organic carbon (DOC) concentrations across European forests","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-435495","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Migraine is a debilitating neurological disorder affecting around one in seven people worldwide, but its molecular mechanisms remain poorly understood. There is some debate about whether migraine is a disease of vascular dysfunction or a result of neuronal dysfunction with secondary vascular changes. Genome-wide association (GWA) studies have thus far identified 13 independent loci associated with migraine. To identify new susceptibility loci, we carried out a genetic study of migraine on 59,674 affected subjects and 316,078 controls from 22 GWA studies. We identified 44 independent single-nucleotide polymorphisms (SNPs) significantly associated with migraine risk (P < 5 × 10(-8)) that mapped to 38 distinct genomic loci, including 28 loci not previously reported and a locus that to our knowledge is the first to be identified on chromosome X. In subsequent computational analyses, the identified loci showed enrichment for genes expressed in vascular and smooth muscle tissues, consistent with a predominant theory of migraine that highlights vascular etiologies.","author_count":50,"contributors":["Gormley, Padhraig","Anttila, Verneri","Winsvold, Bendik S","Palta, Priit","Esko, Tonu","Pers, Tune H.","Farh, Kai-How","Cuenca-Leon, Ester","Muona, Mikko","Furlotte, Nicholas A","Kurth, Tobias","Ingason, Andres","McMahon, George","Ligthart, Lannie","Terwindt, Gisela M","Kallela, Mikko","Freilinger, Tobias M","Ran, Caroline","Gordon, Scott G","Stam, Anine H","Steinberg, Stacy","Borck, Guntram","Koiranen, Markku","Quaye, Lydia","Adams, Hieab H H","Lehtimäki, Terho","Sarin, Antti-Pekka","Wedenoja, Juho","Hinds, David A","Buring, Julie E","Schürks, Markus","Ridker, Paul M","Hrafnsdottir, Maria Gudlaug","Stefansson, Hreinn","Ring, Susan M","Hottenga, Jouke-Jan","Penninx, Brenda W J H","Färkkilä, Markus","Artto, Ville","Kaunisto, Mari","Vepsäläinen, Salli","Malik, Rainer","Heath, Andrew C","Madden, Pamela A F","Martin, Nicholas G","Montgomery, Grant W","Christensen, Anne Francke","Hansen, Thomas Folkmann","Werge, Thomas","Olesen, Jes"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-531774"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corpau":["International Headache Genetics Consortium"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"meta analysis of 000000000375 000000000000 individuals identifies 000000000038 susceptibility loci for migraine","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-531774","identifier":[{"id":"PMC5331903","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84975318713","type":"scopus"},{"id":"27322543","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-e7a13ad2-079b-4ed1-a509-931ace628d29"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0C388A7646EC962A8BCF8FE6392CF2E4"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Novo Nordisk Foundation Center for Basic Metabolic Research, Human Genomics and Metagenomics in Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":2,"key":"international headache genetics consortium","name":"International Headache Genetics Consortium","role":"oau"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Padhraig","key":"gormleypau","last":"Gormley","name":"Gormley, Padhraig","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Verneri","key":"anttilapau","last":"Anttila","name":"Anttila, Verneri","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first