{"abstract":"The paper gives an overview of some of the large, shallow, semi-enclosed coastal systems (SECS) in Europe, These SECS are important both from the ecological and the economic perspective (socio-ecological systems) and provide many valuable ecosystem goods and services.Although some of the systems are transitional waters under the Water Framework Directive, this is not the case for all of the systems. The paper adopts a Driver-Pressure-State-Impact-Response approach to analyse the ecological status, vulnerability and future perspectives of these systems in the context of global change.","author_count":30,"contributors":["Newton, Alice","Icely, John","Cristina, Sónia","Brito, Ana","Cardoso, Ana Cristina","Colijn, Franciscus","Riva, Simona Dalla","Gertz, Flemming","Hansen, Jens Würgler","Holmer, Marianne","Ivanova, Kateryna","Leppäkoski, Erkki","Canu, Donata Melaku","Mocenni, Chiara","Mudge, Stephen","Murray, Nicholas","Pejrup, Morten","Razinkovas, Arturas","Reizopoulou, Sofia","Pérez-Ruzafa, Angel","Schernewski, Gerard","Schubert, Hendrik","Carr, Laishalla","Solidoro, Cosimo","PierluigiViaroli, no-firstname","Zaldívar, José Manuel"],"cuid":["S03-097.14-024392"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Newton, Alice"],"country":["Finland","Germany","Greece","Italy","Lithuania","Norway","Portugal","Spain"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","HZG","Hellenic Centre for Marine Research","Klaipeda University","NILU","National Institute of Oceanography and Applied Geophysics","The Climate and Environmental Research Institute (NILU)","The European Commission","University of Algarve","University of Lisbon","University of Murcia","University of Parma","University of Rostock","University of Siena","Åbo Akademi University"],"keyword":["Coastal lagoon","DPSIR","Ecological status","Global change","Transit