{"abstract":"Peptide-major histocompatibility complex (p-MHC) class I tetramer complexes have facilitated the early detection and functional characterisation of epitope specific CD8(+) cytotoxic T lymphocytes (CTL). Here, we report on the generation of seven recombinant bovine leukocyte antigens (BoLA) and recombinant bovine beta 2-microglobulin from which p-MHC class I tetramers can be derived in similar to 48 h. We validated a set of p-MHC class I tetramers against a panel of CTL lines specific to seven epitopes on five different antigens of Theileria parva, a protozoan pathogen causing the lethal bovine disease East Coast fever. One of the p-MHC class I tetramers was tested in ex vivo assays and we detected T. parva specific CTL in peripheral blood of cattle at day 15-17 post-immunization with a live parasite vaccine. The algorithm NetMHCpan predicted alternative epitope sequences for some of the T. parva CTL epitopes. Using an ELISA assay to measure peptide-BoLA monomer formation and p-MHC class I tetramers of new specificity, we demonstrate that a predicted alternative epitope Tp2(29-37) rather than the previously reported Tp2(27-37) epitope is the correct Tp2 epitope presented by BoLA-6*04101. We also verified the prediction by NetMHCpan that the Tp5(87-95) epitope reported as BoLA-T5 restricted can also be presented by BoLA-1*02301, a molecule similar in sequence to BoLA-T5. In addition, Tp5(87-95) specific bovine CTL were simultaneously stained by Tp5-BoLA-1*02301 and Tp5-BoLA-T5 tetramers suggesting that one T cell receptor can bind to two different BoLA MHC class I molecules presenting the Tp5(87-95) epitope and that these BoLA molecules fall into a single functional supertype.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Svitek, Nicholas","Hansen, Andreas Martin","Steinaa, Lucilla","Saya, Rosemary","Awino, Elias","Nielsen, Morten","Buus, Søren","Nene, Vishvanath"],"cuid":["S02-099.36-035442"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Africa"],"country":["Kenya"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","International Livestock Research Institute"],"keyword":["Algorithms","Amino Acid Sequence","Animals","Antigen Presentation","Cattle","East Coast fever","Enzyme Linked Immunosorbent Assay","Epitopes T Lymphocyte","Histocompatibility Antigens","Immune responses","Major histocompatibility complex","Molecular Sequence Data","Molecules","Protein","Sequence","Sequence Alignment","Specificity","T Lymphocytes Cytotoxic","Theileria parva","Veterinary","beta 2 Microglobulin","binding prediction"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"use of one pot mix and read peptide mhc class i tetramers and predictive algorithms to improve detection of cytotoxic t lymphocyte responses in cattle","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/93077905/Use_of_one_pot.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-099.36-035442","identifier":[{"id":"PMC4018993","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84900850359","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24775445","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-7c863b66-6ae8-4ae1-bbc3-a2cfba26d2a9","ku-3d7b047d-f017-4683-abf6-5e987dbc6894"],"keyword":["ANTIGEN PRESENTATION","Algorithms","Amino Acid Sequence","Animals","BINDING PREDICTION","CELL RESPONSES","Cattle","EAST-COAST FEVER","Enzyme-Linked Immunosorbent Assay","Epitopes, T-Lymphocyte","Histocompatibility Antigens","IMMUNE-RESPONSES","MOLECULES","Major Histocompatibility Complex","Molecular Sequence Data","PROTEIN","SEQUENCE","SPECIFICITY","Sequence Alignment","T-Lymphocytes, Cytotoxic","THEILERIA-PARVA","VETERINARY","beta 2-Microglobulin"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-5BCF03AFE9A6F3F1AA4F0C78BE38CAED"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1297-9716-45-50","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/93077905/Use_of_one_pot.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ke","key":"international livestock research institute","loc":["Kenya","Africa"],"name":"International Livestock Research Institute","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Immunology and Microbiology, Department of Immunology and Microbiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology, Center for Biological Sequence Analysis","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology, Center for Biological Sequence Analysis, Immunological Bioinformatics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nicholas","key":"svitekpau","last":"Svitek","name":"Svitek, Nicholas","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Andreas Martin","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"3ae9d6af-6ad1-4992-b8db-e1e0d753cedb","name":"Hansen, Andreas Martin","rank":2,"rol