mark"],"title":"Mutations in HNF1A Result in Marked Alterations of Plasma Glycan Profile : Diabetes","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-096.36-043327","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"The article introduces a new website, samtalegrammatik.dk ('grammar of talk-in-interaction'), it describes the methods used for constructing the website, and it provides descriptions of three new grammatical phenomena in Danish talk-in-interaction. The website is a result of investigations carried out by the research group DanTIN ('Danish talk-in-interaction') since 2009. Until 2013, the group has published analyses of quite diverse phenomena, such as different versions of the word \"hvad\" 'what' that seem to be-ong to different word classes and have different functions in talk-in- interaction, the distribution of the hesitation marker \"øh(m)\" 'uh(m)', or different word orders after the conjunction \"ford\" ('because'). These phenomena were selected because they were clearly different from written Danish. By launching the website samtalegrammatik.dk the group takes a step towards building a comprehensive grammar of Danish talk-in-interaction. It offers a template for a description of all aspects of the grammar of Danish talk-in-interaction, even though at the time of the launching only a little part of the entries will be filled in. The idea is that the investigations will be continued in many years to come, and, thus, the website will grow and become more complete. The three phenomena reported in some detail here all have intonation as an important part of their grammatical descriptions. They are (1) the particle nå (roughly 'oh'), (2) exaggerated pitch as a story ending device, and (3) the interjection ej, which is an intranslatable exclamation word.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Steensig, Jakob","Brøcker, Karen Kiil","Grønkjær, Caroline","Hamann, Magnus","Hansen, Rasmus Puggaard","Jørgensen, Maria","Kragelund, Mathias Høyer","Mikkelsen, Nicholas Hedegaard","Mølgaard, Tina","Pedersen, Henriette Folkmann","Sørensen, Søren Sandager","Tholstrup, Emilie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-259468"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Danish","Dansk","Grammatical description","Historiefortælling","Particles","Partikler","Prosodi","Prosody","Samtalesprog","Story telling","Talk in interaction"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the dantin project creating a platform for describing the grammar of danish talk in interaction","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/67743279/Final_Sjusk_Steensig_et_al.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-259468","ids":["au-e3ec94ea-2c78-4a2f-8a88-21dc18bf9979"],"keyword":["Danish","Dansk","Talk-in-interaction","grammatical description","grammatisk beskrivelse","historiefortælling","particles","partikler","prosodi","prosody","samtalesprog","story-telling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A2A6C38C0C2F42961FC2B772C7E606AA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/67743279/Final_Sjusk_Steensig_et_al.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Linguistics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jakob","key":"steensigpau","last":"Steensig","locid":"a3beb88f-0b18-435d-a36d-a1f98646a0e2","name":"Steensig, Jakob","orcid":"0000-0003-4546-8910","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"