lancing micro-switch in the activation of the β2-adrenergic receptor","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-434134","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Adiposity, assessed as elevated body mass index (BMI), is associated with increased risk of ischemic heart disease (IHD); however, whether this is causal is unknown. We tested the hypothesis that positive observational associations between BMI and IHD are causal.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Nordestgaard, Børge G","Palmer, Tom M","Benn, Marianne","Zacho, Jeppe","Tybjærg-Hansen, Anne","Davey Smith, George","Timpson, Nicholas J"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-515234"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the effect of elevated body mass index on ischemic heart disease risk causal estimates from a mendelian randomisation approach","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pmed.1001212","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-515234","identifier":[{"id":"84861537866","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-cbf021a2-5d3b-4442-bc84-f1b60e340478"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E1936FE866B7B79313FF1F2F40BDEFD2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pmed.1001212","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Diagnostic Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Børge G","key":"nordestgaardpau","last":"Nordestgaard","lo