{"abstract":"Positron emission tomography (PET) imaging of serotonin 2A (5-HT(2A)) receptors with agonist tracers holds promise for the selective labelling of 5-HT(2A) receptors in their high-affinity state. We have previously validated [(11)C]Cimbi-5 and found that it is a 5-HT(2A) receptor agonist PET tracer. In an attempt to further optimize the target-to-background binding ratio, we modified the chemical structure of the phenethylamine backbone and carbon-11 labelling site of [(11)C]Cimbi-5 in different ways. Here, we present the in vivo validation of nine novel 5-HT(2A) receptor agonist PET tracers in the pig brain.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Ettrup, Anders","Hansen, Martin","Santini, Martin A","Paine, James Stephen","Gillings, Nicholas Mathew","Palner, Mikael","Lehel, Szabolcs","Herth, Matthias M.","Madsen, Jacob","Kristensen, Jesper Langgaard","Begtrup, Mikael","Knudsen, Gitte Moos"],"cuid":["S02-095.00-045615"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"radiosynthesis and in vivo evaluation of a series of substituted sup 000000000011 sup c phenethylamines as 000000000005 ht sub 000000000002a sub agonist pet tracers","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00259-010-1686-8","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-095.00-045615","identifier":[{"id":"21174090","type":"pmid"},{"id":"79953727230","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-b7c5930b-e441-4d0e-b916-a18e227b457c","ku-ddbf29d4-fe9d-40e3-9388-5ef75dce8b2c"],"keyword":["Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences"],"lang":"En